all that awaits you is hell.

00:13:36.260 --> 00:13:37.400
Well, well.

00:13:37.400 --> 00:13:41.250
Why don't you show me 
this "hell" you speak of?

00:13:41.250 --> 00:13:41.550
Haganai: I Don't Have Many Friends
Yomi Hirasaka\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hBuriki

00:13:44.460 --> 00:13:46.760
Wh-What are you doing?!

00:13:46.760 --> 00:13:49.230
I'm showing you hell.

00:13:49.230 --> 00:13:52.510
Aren't you happy? Now you can 
practice fixing your hair.

00:13:52.510 --> 00:13:54.200
He's totally...

00:13:54.200 --> 00:13:55.660
He's hiding his embarrassment.

00:13:56.740 --> 00:13:59.280
Th-This is bullying!

00:13:59.280 --> 00:14:01.020
Bullying, I tell you!

00:14:01.020 --> 00:14:02.320
You might be right.

00:14:02.320 --> 00:14:03.340
In that case...

00:14:03.980 --> 00:14:06.490
You should get bullied too.

00:14:07.780 --> 00:14:09.490
If you insist.

00:14:22.470 --> 00:14:23.920
There's no way!

00:14:23.920 --> 00:14:26.420
I can't confess. It's too soon!

00:14:26.730 --> 00:14:31.150
Maybe we should give her a 
little more time, Akatsuki-san.

00:14:31.150 --> 00:14:33.390
I'm sure she needs to prepare mentally.

00:14:33.390 --> 00:14:36.390
Sh-She's right! I'm not prepared at all!

00:14:36.390 --> 00:14:38.440
Then prepare yourself right now.

00:14:38.440 --> 00:14:39.340
What?

00:14:39.340 --> 00:14:40.560
Listen up.

00:14:40.560 --> 00:14:44.860
If you can't psych yourself 
up right now, you never will.

00:14:44.860 --> 00:14:47.530
Quit expecting your future self 
to do all the heavy lifting.

00:14:47.880 --> 00:14:50.030
Never put off till tomorrow 
what can be done today!

00:14:50.550 --> 00:14:54.780
The longer you put it off,
the harder it'll be.

00:14:54.780 --> 00:14:57.180
If you let him view you as a 
friend for months or years,

00:14:57.180 --> 00:15:00.290
he'll be way more put off when 
you <i>do</i> make the confession!

00:15:00.680 --> 00:15:05.380
That's why your chances of success
are higher the sooner you strike.

00:15:07.170 --> 00:15:08.760
B-But...

00:15:08.760 --> 00:15:13.050
I'm awkward. And annoying.

00:15:13.050 --> 00:15:15.640
The only good thing about me is my chest.

00:15:15.640 --> 00:15:19.020
At least your confidence
 in your breasts is rock-steady.

00:15:19.020 --> 00:15:20.640
What do you think, Yume-chan?

00:15:22.660 --> 00:15:26.120
He seems to enjoy spending 
time with you, Higashira-san.

00:15:26.760 --> 00:15:31.660
So if you said you wanted to spend more 
time together, I doubt he'd refuse.

00:15:32.560 --> 00:15:34.550
You think so?

00:15:35.120 --> 00:15:39.540
Do you really think I can be his girlfriend?

00:15:39.540 --> 00:15:41.100
I do.

00:15:41.100 --> 00:15:43.040
I guarantee it.

00:15:45.920 --> 00:15:47.920
Irido

00:15:47.920 --> 00:15:53.180
<i>So he asked if they could meet 
up behind the school at five.</i>

00:15:53.470 --> 00:15:57.600
<i>He's probably realized 
she's gonna confess to him, huh?</i>

00:15:57.600 --> 00:15:58.880
Probably.

00:15:58.880 --> 00:16:02.560
<i>Man, now even I'm getting nervous.</i>

00:16:03.050 --> 00:16:04.140
<i>I get that.</i>

00:16:04.140 --> 00:16:05.610
Well, Yume-chan,

00:16:05.610 --> 00:16:08.570
are you excited that your stepbrother's 
about to get a girlfriend?

00:16:09.840 --> 00:16:12.070
You think he'll say yes?

00:16:12.070 --> 00:16:15.390
Don't you? I mean, that's the typical thing.

00:16:15.850 --> 00:16:19.370
But I guess Irido-kun 
isn't your typical guy, huh?

00:16:19.370 --> 00:16:20.580
<i>He's not?</i>

00:16:20.580 --> 00:16:24.120
Yeah. If I had one worry, 
I guess it'd be that.

00:16:24.120 --> 00:16:28.030
Like whether he sees any value 
in getting a girlfriend or not.

00:16:28.030 --> 00:16:31.040
I guess he probably doesn't.

00:16:31.040 --> 00:16:33.470
He seems like he'd be just fine without one.

00:16:33.470 --> 00:16:37.930
Like he's the type who doesn't
 see any value in having a partner.

00:16:37.930 --> 00:16:41.560
So if a guy like him <i>were</i> to get a girlfriend...

00:16:56.980 --> 00:16:58.830
Yup, lookin' good.

00:16:58.830 --> 00:17:01.750
D-Do I really look okay?

00:17:02.060 --> 00:17:03.500
You're fine, you're fine.

00:17:03.500 --> 00:17:04.750
Cute as a button!

00:17:04.870 --> 00:17:06.250
Friday, June 24th

00:17:06.980 --> 00:17:08.250
It's almost time.

00:17:09.440 --> 00:17:11.250
I'm starting to get nervous.

00:17:11.990 --> 00:17:15.850
Okay then, we'll stay hidden over here 
and support you from the shadows.

00:17:15.850 --> 00:17:16.840
Good luck!

00:17:17.520 --> 00:17:20.100
You'll be fine. You can do this.

00:17:25.100 --> 00:17:27.100
Right, I'll do my best.

00:17:41.780 --> 00:17:43.740
I'm here, Higashira.

00:17:44.120 --> 00:17:49.470
U-Um... Th-Thank you 
for coming t-to meet me.

00:17:49.470 --> 00:17:50.310
Sure.

00:17:51.630 --> 00:17:54.040
S-So... you know...

00:17:54.040 --> 00:17:58.030
Th-There's something I wanted 
to tell you, Mizuto-kun.

00:17:58.030 --> 00:18:00.010
To express my gratitude...

00:18:00.010 --> 00:18:02.830
No, scratch that. What I mean is...

00:18:02.830 --> 00:18:04.330
Um... Um...

00:18:04.330 --> 00:18:04.890
Higashira.

00:18:04.890 --> 00:18:06.140
Y-Yes?!

00:18:06.770 --> 00:18:10.340
Just tell me what you have to say at your 
own pace. In whatever order you'd like.

00:18:10.860 --> 00:18:12.650
I can put the pieces together from there.

00:18:16.040 --> 00:18:21.660
Do you remember when we first met at the 
library and you came up to talk to me?

00:18:23.700 --> 00:18:25.760
That made me so happy.

00:18:25.760 --> 00:18:29.880
And not just because I'd met someone 
who shared similar interests.

00:18:29.880 --> 00:18:34.170
But because when we spoke, you actually
seemed to enjoy talking to me.

00:18:34.480 --> 00:18:40.560
People have always told me that 
I'm weird, annoying, and a freak.

00:18:40.560 --> 00:18:42.100
So truly, deeply...

00:18:42.660 --> 00:18:46.680
I was so happy to have someone actually 
listen to me when I ramble.

00:18:46.940 --> 00:18:52.270
Not only that, but for the first time ever,
someone actually responded to me.

00:18:53.620 --> 00:18:54.970
It's been so much fun.

00:18:56.290 --> 00:18:58.920
So I wanna spend more time with you.

00:18:58.920 --> 00:19:01.450
I wanna spend all my time with you.

00:19:03.580 --> 00:19:08.230
So... please let me be your girlfriend.

00:19:10.100 --> 00:19:11.290
I like you.

00:19:18.000 --> 00:19:20.720
You always told me you saw me as a friend.

00:19:20.720 --> 00:19:23.100
Th-That hasn't changed!

00:19:23.100 --> 00:19:25.680
I like you as a friend too.

00:19:25.980 --> 00:19:29.210
I enjoy spending time 
with you too, Higashira.

00:19:29.210 --> 00:19:33.940
You're the first person I've ever met 
that I've clicked with so effortlessly.

00:19:34.380 --> 00:19:39.940
So if we were to date, there's no 
doubt in my mind that we'd be happy.

00:19:40.530 --> 00:19:42.440
Sure, we'd still fight.

00:19:42.440 --> 00:19:45.700
Knowing us, we'd likely forget all about it
while discussing some new book.

00:19:48.230 --> 00:19:50.460
But I'm sorry.

00:19:52.580 --> 00:19:55.840
I'm sorry, but I can't go out with you.

00:19:56.550 --> 00:19:58.840
Wh-Why?

00:19:59.170 --> 00:20:01.630
I'm selfish.

00:20:01.630 --> 00:20:04.920
I can't be attentive to more 
than one person at a time.

00:20:05.350 --> 00:20:07.680
And the one slot that I have...

00:20:07.680 --> 00:20:11.750
It's already occupied by someone else, 
even though she doesn't deserve it.

00:20:12.350 --> 00:20:14.520
And I know in my heart

00:20:15.150 --> 00:20:19.690
that despite having no obligation to her,
 I still can't bear to see her cry.

00:20:21.060 --> 00:20:23.080
So I'll apologize again and again.

00:20:23.520 --> 00:20:24.720
I'm sorry.

00:20:24.720 --> 00:20:29.240
I'm doing you a disservice by using someone 
else to turn you down, and I apologize.

00:20:29.760 --> 00:20:31.580
But it's not your fault at all.

00:20:31.580 --> 00:20:33.720
There's no one else to blame either.

00:20:33.720 --> 00:20:35.350
This is on me.

00:20:35.880 --> 00:20:40.380
These are just feelings I know I 
have that I simply cannot deny.

00:20:40.970 --> 00:20:43.130
So I'm sorry, Higashira, but I...

00:20:44.100 --> 00:20:46.150
I can't be your boyfriend.

00:20:51.960 --> 00:20:55.770
<i>So if a guy like him </i>were<i> to get a girlfriend...</i>

00:20:55.770 --> 00:20:59.210
<i>since he wouldn't be doing it 
for pride or status,</i>

00:20:59.210 --> 00:21:04.330
<i>it'd have to be someone he just wants 
to have by his side that badly.</i>

00:21:05.830 --> 00:21:11.050
<i>Even though it's obvious you'd 
be better off with her than me...</i>

00:21:12.130 --> 00:21:16.380
<i>Even though I'm nothing but 
a stepsister to you now...</i>

00:21:18.000 --> 00:21:22.570
<i>Why are you letting someone who isn't 
even your girlfriend anymore</i>

00:21:23.520 --> 00:21:25.340
<i>be the one by your side?</i>

00:23:03.540 --> 00:23:05.570
Well, explain yourself!

00:23:05.570 --> 00:23:07.000
Explain what?

00:23:07.000 --> 00:23:08.570
This, of course.

00:23:08.570 --> 00:23:13.070
Edit

00:23:08.570 --> 00:23:13.070
Haganai: I Don't Have
 Many Friends

00:23:09.280 --> 00:23:12.650
It's a picture of me and Mizuto-kun 
talking in the library.

00:23:14.290 --> 00:23:16.330
Is there something wrong with that?

00:23:16.330 --> 00:23:18.760
He just rejected you, didn't he?

00:23:18.760 --> 00:23:21.460
How can you talk to him
 like nothing's changed?

00:23:21.770 --> 00:23:24.560
Um... I may have gotten my heart broken,

00:23:24.560 --> 00:23:26.840
but it's not like we stopped being friends.

00:23:27.400 --> 00:23:28.340
Huh?

00:23:28.600 --> 00:23:30.430
If anything, now that he's rejected me,

00:23:30.430 --> 00:23:34.970
it makes being friends more easygoing 
and straightforward, don't you think?

00:23:35.310 --> 00:23:37.700
Have you lost your mind?!
